    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3847\"><em data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3847\">(18th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Administrative Pressure:</strong> +3</p><p data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3921\">You end the manifestation of a feral god, tulpa, or rogue divine entity.</p><p data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"4013\">The manifestation collapses and cannot reconstitute for a meaningful time (GM discretion).</p><p data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4109\">This does not erase the entity from existence.<br data-start=\"4061\" data-end=\"4064\" />It removes its current operational authority.</p><h3 data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4119\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4167\">Significant Civic Charge expenditure (2+ dice).</p><h3 data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4183\">Escalation</h3><p data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4268\">If the entity is Out of Compliance, the shutdown bypasses typical divine resistance.</p><h3 data-start=\"4270\" data-end=\"4282\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"4283\" data-end=\"4317\">This is a jurisdictional incident.</p><p data-start=\"4319\" data-end=\"4326\">Expect:</p><ul data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4413\"><li data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4347\"><p data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4347\">Divine retaliation</p></li><li data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4368\"><p data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4368\">Political scrutiny</p></li><li data-start=\"4369\" data-end=\"4385\"><p data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4385\">Mandate audits</p></li><li data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4413\"><p data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4413\">Rival Auditor involvement</p></li></ul>",
